# Services whose addresses are pulled into ipset.list by ipset-update.sh
# One service domain per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Keep this list short and specific. Every service listed here adds its
# addresses to ipset.list, and every address in that file is desynced
# regardless of SNI, so a service that does not need the bypass only costs
# CPU and adds risk.
#
# youtube.com is deliberately absent: its addresses pull in shared Google
# infrastructure and break unrelated Google services.
#
# Anything that must never be desynced goes into lists/ipset_exclude.list,
# which takes priority over ipset.list.

discord.com
discord.gg
discord.media

# Add your own below, for example:
# instagram.com
# x.com
